     1	"""One model call, archived and replayable.
     2	
     3	`call()` sends a system and user message with a strict JSON schema to an OpenAI-compatible chat endpoint (OpenAI,
     4	or DeepSeek through the same wire format), checks the answer against the schema, and records the exact request and
     5	raw answer in an archive (SQLite, a POC artefact kept beside the test database, never inside the views database).
     6	A request whose sha256 is already in the archive is answered from it without a network call, so a rerun of a
     7	replay costs nothing and gives the same answers. The provider key is read from the owner-only credentials file and
     8	never appears in the archive, logs or arguments.
     9	"""
